# Skybound Card Images

Public Skybound card assets are organized by catalog type under this set-scoped directory.
Generated progressive thumbnails mirror those paths beneath `thumb/`.

- Keep this additive; do not relocate cards from earlier sets.
- Collectors 419–472 use their released non-foil alternate-art source images. Collector 450
  includes both front and reverse faces.
- Do not commit printing-production foil images. Foil database rows reuse non-foil art.
- Run the repository thumbnail generator after adding or changing a public source image.
- Preserve collector-number filename prefixes so migrations and audit manifests stay traceable.
